Bolum Input Deck
User must define diameter, velocity, theta_deg, init_strength, and density for the code to run
diameter            = 0.35        # meters
velocity            = 14400.0    # entry velocity in m/s (ranges from 11200 to ~70000)
theta_deg           = 72.        # degrees from the horizontal
init_strength       = 4.e6       # Pa
density             = 3400.0     # kg/m^3


Innisfree (1977)



